#: ../../source/big-integer_README.md:10
msgid ""
"**BigInteger.js** is an arbitrary-length integer library for Javascript, "
"allowing arithmetic operations on integers of unlimited size, "
"notwithstanding memory and time limitations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/big-integer_README.md:12
msgid ""
"**Update (December 2, 2018):** [`BigInt` is being added as a native "
"feature of JavaScript](https://tc39.github.io/proposal-bigint/). This "
"library now works as a polyfill: if the environment supports the native "
"`BigInt`, this library acts as a thin wrapper over the native "
"implementation."
msgstr ""

